--- !u!114 &1141883406
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1141883404}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A causa raiz era que SaveData j\xE1 tinha interactedNPCs e defeatedBosses,
    mas ningu\xE9m preenchia nem restaurava essas listas. Corrigi isso e o bot\xE3o
    \u201CContinuar\u201D agora come\xE7a oculto e s\xF3 aparece quando o auto-save
    existe.\r\nTamb\xE9m ajustei a persist\xEAncia/restore:\r\n\u2022\r\nPause.AutoSaveCurrentGame()
    agora captura NPCs conclu\xEDdos e bosses derrotados antes de salvar.\r\n\u2022\r\nSaveRestoreManager
    reaplica esse estado ao carregar o save.\r\n\u2022\r\nNPCInteractable e BossArena
    receberam IDs est\xE1veis e m\xE9todos para restaurar estado.\r\n\u2022\r\nMenuUI
    for\xE7a continueButton para SetActive(false) no Start/OnEnable e s\xF3 ativa
    quando SaveManager.HasAutosave for true.\r\nPara adicionar no menu no Unity:\r\n\u2022\r\nabra
    a cena Menu\r\n\u2022\r\ncrie um GameObject vazio e adicione o script MenuUI\r\n\u2022\r\narraste
    o bot\xE3o \u201CContinuar\u201D para o campo ContinueButton\r\n\u2022\r\narraste
    o LevelLoader se existir\r\n\u2022\r\ngaranta que SaveManager e SaveRestoreManager
    existam no Boot/scene persistente (DontDestroyOnLoad)\r\n\u2022\r\no fluxo fica:
    save -> HasAutosave true -> bot\xE3o vis\xEDvel -> click -> carrega save e reaplica
    NPC/boss.\r\nValida\xE7\xE3o: build do projeto conclu\xEDdo com sucesso."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
